id=netstats-fix
name=Network Stats Fix for GSI
version=v15
versionCode=15
author=Hirbod-JORFlint
description=Universal fix for broken traffic indicator on Android GSIs. BPF restoration + per-UID stats population in BPF maps + /proc/uid_stat/ fallback + xt_qtaguid loading. Native binder proxy v10.0 with dynamic interfaces, per-UID stat distribution, watchdog. Handles system/system_axion/system_infinity variants.
